{"seq":2,"slug":"lc0787-cheapest-flights-k-stops","title":"LeetCode 787 K 站中转内最便宜的航班","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/hard-graph-advanced/lc0787-cheapest-flights-k-stops","wordCount":664,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"leetcode-787-k-站中转内最便宜的航班\">LeetCode 787 K 站中转内最便宜的航班</h1><h2 id=\"题目描述\">题目描述</h2><p>有 <code>n</code> 个城市通过一些航班连接。给定一个数组 <code>flights</code>，其中 <code>flights[i] = [fromi, toi, pricei]</code> 表示从城市 <code>fromi</code> 到城市 <code>toi</code> 的航班价格为 <code>pricei</code>。</p>\n<p>给定所有的城市数 <code>n</code>、航班列表 <code>flights</code>、出发城市 <code>src</code>、目的城市 <code>dst</code> 以及经停站的数量限制 <code>k</code>，请找出从 <code>src</code> 到 <code>dst</code> 最多经过 <code>k</code> 站中转的<strong>最便宜</strong>价格。如果不存在这样的路线，则返回 <code>-1</code>。</p>\n<p><strong>约束条件：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>1 &lt;= n &lt;= 100</code></li>\n<li><code>0 &lt;= flights.length &lt;= n * (n - 1) / 2</code></li>\n<li><code>flights[i].length == 3</code></li>\n<li><code>0 &lt;= fromi, toi &lt; n</code></li>\n<li><code>fromi != toi</code></li>\n<li><code>1 &lt;= pricei &lt;= 10^4</code></li>\n<li>航班没有重复，且不存在自环</li>\n<li><code>0 &lt;= src, dst, k &lt; n</code></li>\n<li><code>src != dst</code></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>示例 1：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"输入：n = 4, flights = [[0,1,100],[1,2,100],[2,0,100],[1,3,600],[2,3,200]], src = 0, dst = 3, k = 1&#10;输出：700&#10;解释：从城市 0 到城市 3，经过 1 站中转的最优路径为 0→1→3，价格 100+600=700。\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>输入：n = 4, flights = [[0,1,100],[1,2,100],[2,0,100],[1,3,600],[2,3,200]], src = 0, dst = 3, k = 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>输出：700</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>解释：从城市 0 到城市 3，经过 1 站中转的最优路径为 0→1→3，价格 100+600=700。</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>示例 2：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"输入：n = 3, flights = [[0,1,100],[1,2,100],[0,2,500]], src = 0, dst = 2, k = 1&#10;输出：200&#10;解释：路径 0→1→2 经过 1 站中转，价格 200，优于直飞的 500。\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>输入：n = 3, flights = [[0,1,100],[1,2,100],[0,2,500]], src = 0, dst = 2, k = 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>输出：200</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>解释：路径 0→1→2 经过 1 站中转，价格 200，优于直飞的 500。</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>示例 3：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"输入：n = 3, flights = [[0,1,100],[1,2,100],[0,2,500]], src = 0, dst = 2, k = 0&#10;输出：500&#10;解释：k=0 表示不允许中转，只能直飞 0→2，价格 500。\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>输入：n = 3, flights = [[0,1,100],[1,2,100],[0,2,500]], src = 0, dst = 2, k = 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>输出：500</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>解释：k=0 表示不允许中转，只能直飞 0→2，价格 500。</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"解题思路\">解题思路</h2><p>本题是<strong>带限制条件的最短路径</strong>问题。经典 Dijkstra 算法不能直接使用，因为贪心策略可能会选择中转次数过多的路径。</p>\n<p><strong>方法一：Bellman-Ford 变体</strong></p>\n<p>Bellman-Ford 算法天然支持限制松弛轮数。标准 Bellman-Ford 进行 V-1 轮松弛，本题只需进行 k+1 轮（k 次中转意味着最多走 k+1 条边）。</p>\n<p>关键点：每轮松弛时，必须使用<strong>上一轮的距离数组副本</strong>来更新，而非当前轮的数组。否则同一轮内的多次松弛会导致中转次数超限。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[初始化 dist 数组] --&gt; B[第 1 轮松弛]&#10;    B --&gt; C[第 2 轮松弛]&#10;    C --&gt; D[...]&#10;    D --&gt; E[第 k+1 轮松弛]&#10;    E --&gt; F{dist 目的地 &lt; ∞?}&#10;    F --&gt;|是| G[返回 dist 目的地]&#10;    F --&gt;|否| H[返回 -1]\">graph LR\n    A[初始化 dist 数组] --&gt; B[第 1 轮松弛]\n    B --&gt; C[第 2 轮松弛]\n    C --&gt; D[...]\n    D --&gt; E[第 k+1 轮松弛]\n    E --&gt; F{dist 目的地 &lt; ∞?}\n    F --&gt;|是| G[返回 dist 目的地]\n    F --&gt;|否| H[返回 -1]</pre><p><strong>方法二：动态规划</strong></p>\n<p>定义 <code>dp[t][v]</code> 为最多经过 <code>t</code> 条边到达节点 <code>v</code> 的最小花费。状态转移方程：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"dp[t][v] = min(dp[t-1][v], min(dp[t-1][u] + w(u,v)) for all edges (u,v))\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>dp[t][v] = min(dp[t-1][v], min(dp[t-1][u] + w(u,v)) for all edges (u,v))</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这与 Bellman-Ford 的本质完全一致，只是用 DP 的视角来理解。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>时间复杂度</th>\n<th>空间复杂度</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Bellman-Ford 变体</td>\n<td>O(k × E)</td>\n<td>O(V)</td>\n<td>简洁，直接控制轮数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>动态规划</td>\n<td>O(k × E)</td>\n<td>O(k × V) 可优化至 O(V)</td>\n<td>思路清晰，易理解</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>BFS + 优先队列</td>\n<td>O(E × k)</td>\n<td>O(V × k)</td>\n<td>类似分层 Dijkstra</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DFS + 记忆化</td>\n<td>O(V × k × E)</td>\n<td>O(V × k)</td>\n<td>可能超时</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Bellman-Ford 变体是本题最优雅的解法，代码简洁且正确。</p>\n<h2 id=\"代码实现\">代码实现</h2><p><strong>Bellman-Ford 变体：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function findCheapestPrice(n: number, flights: number[][], src: number, dst: number, k: number): number {&#10;  let dist = new Array(n).fill(Infinity);&#10;  dist[src] = 0;&#10;&#10;  for (let i = 0; i &lt;= k; i++) {&#10;    const prev = [...dist];&#10;    for (const [u, v, w] of flights) {&#10;      if (prev[u] &lt; Infinity &amp;&amp; prev[u] + w &lt; dist[v]) {&#10;        dist[v] = prev[u] + w;&#10;      }&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return dist[dst] === Infinity ? -1 : dist[dst];&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> findCheapestPrice</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">n</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">flights</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[][], </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">src</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">dst</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">k</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dist </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Array</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(n).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">fill</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Infinity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  dist[src] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> k; i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> prev</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">...</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">dist];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">u</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">v</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">w</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> flights) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (prev[u] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Infinity</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> prev[u] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> w </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dist[v]) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        dist[v] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> prev[u] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> w;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dist[dst] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Infinity</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ?</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> :</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dist[dst];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>动态规划解法：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function findCheapestPriceDP(n: number, flights: number[][], src: number, dst: number, k: number): number {&#10;  const INF = Infinity;&#10;  let prev = new Array(n).fill(INF);&#10;  prev[src] = 0;&#10;&#10;  for (let t = 1; t &lt;= k + 1; t++) {&#10;    const curr = [...prev];&#10;    for (const [u, v, w] of flights) {&#10;      if (prev[u] &lt; INF &amp;&amp; prev[u] + w &lt; curr[v]) {&#10;        curr[v] = prev[u] + w;&#10;      }&#10;    }&#10;    prev = curr;&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return prev[dst] === INF ? -1 : prev[dst];&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> findCheapestPriceDP</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">n</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">flights</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</s